  "description": "UK-handcrafted titanium. Exceptional specification. Distinctive finish.\n\nHandcrafted in Sussex from 3Al/2.5V titanium, the Enigma Explor combines flat-bar adventure geometry with the comfort, durability and responsive ride quality of titanium. Designed for gravel, trails and mixed-terrain exploration, it offers confident handling across a wide range of surfaces.\n\nThis exceptional Medium showroom build features SRAM XX Eagle gearing, Hope Fortus wheels, Fox 34 suspension and a USE carbon cockpit with dropper seatpost. Its distinctive black Cerakote finish, gold anodised logos and matching seat tube detailing make it a particularly striking example.\n\nSAVE 26% – WAS £9,525, NOW £6,999\n\nCondition: Brand new and never ridden. Used exclusively for showroom display and photography, this bike remains in immaculate, as-new condition and is supplied with a full Enigma warranty.\n\nFinish: Black Cerakote with gold anodised logos and seat tube detailing\n\nSize & Availability\n\nMedium – Only one available.\n\nA unique opportunity to own a UK-handcrafted Enigma Explor with premium components and an individually finished titanium frame at a significantly reduced price.\n\nScroll through the product gallery to view the frame geometry.",
